<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 19.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Thursday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- Central Bank Samurai bond issue in Japan successful.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali confers with Prime Minister Hamed Karoui and recommends that information sources be opened to journalists.</p>
<p>- Foreign Investments in Tunisia seen increasing, International cooperation and Foreign Investment Minister Mohamed Ghannouchi said.</p>
</text>
